  "shortDescription": "Render objects as circle cut out for circular profile pictures.",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": [
    "Now you can clip profile pictures or images so you don't render a square, features added:",
    "- Circle Clipping (Radius)",
    "- Square Clipping (Size)",
    "- Free Clipping (Points)",
    "",
    "That's all, thanks for supporting the extension."
  ],
